  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>We have been given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>adj</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>|</mo><mo>adj</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>|</mo></math></p><p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;but&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><menclose notation=\"box\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></menclose></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mi>B</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>12</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>12</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>8</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>96</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the correct option.</p></blockquote>",
